       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GENAPP-MAP5-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       COPY SSMAP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           IF EIBCALEN > 0
               EXEC CICS RECEIVE MAP('SSMAPP5')
                 INTO(SSMAPP5I) MAPSET('SSMAP') END-EXEC
               MOVE ENP5LNOI TO ENP5LNOO
               MOVE ENP5PNOI TO ENP5PNOO
               MOVE ENP5CNOI TO ENP5CNOO
               MOVE ENP5CAUI TO ENP5CAUO
               MOVE 'Claim input echoed' TO ERP5FLDO
           ELSE
               INITIALIZE SSMAPP5I SSMAPP5O
           END-IF
           EXEC CICS SEND MAP('SSMAPP5') FROM(SSMAPP5O)
             MAPSET('SSMAP') ERASE END-EXEC
           EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('SSP5')
             COMMAREA(COBCICS-COMMAREA) LENGTH(1) END-EXEC.
